  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 836a4cb26276cde4093849b74cf6ad68, type: 3}
  m_Name: Regulations
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  bookTitle: "Deprem Y\xF6netmeli\u011Fi (\xD6zet)"
  pages:
  - title: Beton
    body: "\u2022 Yeni binalarda beton s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 en az <b>C25</b> olmal\u0131d\u0131r.\n\u2022
      C16 / C20 betonla vize VER\u0130LEMEZ.\n\u2022 Betonda <b>y\u0131kanmam\u0131\u015F
      deniz kumu</b> kullan\u0131lamaz: i\xE7indeki tuz (klor\xFCr) donat\u0131y\u0131
      pasland\u0131r\u0131r, kolon zamanla ta\u015F\u0131ma g\xFCc\xFCn\xFC kaybeder.\n\u2022
      Beton test raporu proje de\u011Ferleriyle uyumlu olmal\u0131d\u0131r."
  - title: Zemin
    body: "\u2022 Zemin s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131 <b>ZE</b> veya <b>ZF</b> ise (gev\u015Fek
      kum, al\xFCvyon, s\u0131\u011F yeralt\u0131 suyu) <b>SIVILA\u015EMA</b> riski
      vard\u0131r.\n\u2022 Bu zeminlerde <b>kaz\u0131kl\u0131 temel</b> veya zemin
      iyile\u015Ftirmesi ZORUNLUDUR.\n\u2022 S\u0131v\u0131la\u015Fma riskli zeminde
      kaz\u0131ks\u0131z radye/tekil temel yetersizdir; bina deprem s\u0131ras\u0131nda
      yan yatabilir."
  - title: Kolon & Kat
    body: "\u2022 <b>YUMU\u015EAK KAT:</b> Zemin kat y\xFCksekli\u011Fi, \xFCst kat
      y\xFCksekli\u011Finin 1,5 kat\u0131n\u0131 a\u015Famaz (\xF6r. 3 m \u2192 en
      fazla 4,5 m).\n\u2022 Ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131 <b>kolon kesilemez</b>,
      kald\u0131r\u0131lamaz. D\xFCkk\xE2n/vitrin i\xE7in zemin katta kolon iptali
      yasakt\u0131r.\n\u2022 Perde duvarlar planda dengeli (simetrik) yerle\u015Fmelidir."
  - title: Gri Alan
    body: "Deprem g\xFCvenli\u011Fini ETK\u0130LEMEYEN mimari farklar <b>onay engeli
      de\u011Fildir</b>:\n\u2022 Balkon \xF6l\xE7\xFCs\xFCnde \xB120 cm fark\n\u2022
      Cephe rengi, do\u011Frama malzemesi\n\u2022 \u0130\xE7 b\xF6lme duvarlar\u0131n\u0131n
      yeri\n\nBunlar i\xE7in revizyon istemek zaman ve para kaybettirir."
  - title: Karar
    body: "<b>ONAY damgas\u0131:</b> proje g\xFCvenli \u2192 +1.000 TL vize harc\u0131.\n<b>KIRMIZI
      KALEM + ONAY:</b> \xF6l\xFCmc\xFCl hatalar\u0131 i\u015Faretle, revizyonla
      onayla \u2192 +500 TL, bina g\xFC\xE7lendirilir.\n<b>RED damgas\u0131:</b>
      proje kurtar\u0131lamaz \u2192 0 TL.\n<b>R\xFC\u015Fvet:</b> cebin dolar ama
      hatal\u0131 bina oldu\u011Fu gibi yap\u0131l\u0131r.\n\nDamgal\u0131 ba\u015Fvuru
      formunu m\xFCteahhide uzatarak (ortaya s\xFCr\xFCkleyerek) karar\u0131 teslim
      et."
